class TaskBinding {record Bound(int kind,Object stack){}static Object create(int kind,int capacity){if(kind==0){IGenStack<String>s=new ArrayStack<>(new String[capacity]);return new Bound(kind,s);}Integer[]storage=new Integer[capacity];java.util.Arrays.fill(storage,42);IGenStack<Integer>s=new ArrayStack<>(storage);return new Bound(kind,s);}@SuppressWarnings("unchecked")static void push(Object value,Object element)throws Exception{Bound b=(Bound)value;if(b.kind==0)((IGenStack<String>)b.stack).push((String)element);else ((IGenStack<Integer>)b.stack).push((Integer)element);}@SuppressWarnings("unchecked")static Object pop(Object value)throws Exception{Bound b=(Bound)value;return b.kind==0?((IGenStack<String>)b.stack).pop():((IGenStack<Integer>)b.stack).pop();}static boolean full(Exception x){return x instanceof StackFullException;}static boolean empty(Exception x){return x instanceof StackEmptyException;}}
